Sun Nov  8 06:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of SyncThingy 1.0, replacing the unmaintained
  QSyncthingTray
  * Add syncthingy-qt6.patch: build with Qt 6 (Leap 16.0 has no
    libportal-qt5) and without libportal
  * Bundle SingleApplication (upstream git submodule)
  * Add syncthingy-native.patch: open URIs with QDesktopServices,
    native XDG autostart entry instead of the Background portal,
    tray icons looked up under the installed app ID, and the service
    dialog uses the syncthing.service user unit
